| State | Driver | Design Decision | Rationale |
|-------|--------|----------------|-----------|
| Fully Addressed | UC1 & QA4 & QA5 & CON6 & QA7 | UI elements | Users can ask questions and view results on web and mobile with accessibility |
| Fully Addressed | UC3 & CON1 | Integration Services | Sync External University Systems Efficiently |
| Fully Addressed | UC4 & CON2 & QA3 | Auth Service (SSO) | Provides secure login and personalized options |
| Fully Addressed | UC5 & CON5 | User Service / Database | manage users and their data |
| Fully Addressed | UC1 & QA5 & QA7 & CON5 | Rich Internet Application | User-friendly web-based layout capable of inputting questions into AIDAP on many systems |
| Partially Addressed | QA2 & QA6 & CON4 & UC6 | Monitoring Services | Monitoring Services |
| Partially Addressed | CON3 & QA1 | API Gateway & Cache | Ensures <2s response via routing and cache |
| Partially Addressed | UC2 | Session Manager & Notifications | Allows reminders to be set and sent reliably |
